// Ch10: the eldest on her platform. Before the tide, the rule; after it, thanks in the Kirru way.
title: ch10_bark_owa
location: ch10/reedhollow
---
<<if $ch10_farewell_tide_seen>>
    Owa as "The eldest" [neutral]: You kept your backs to the water. Good. The three did not have to see you while they went. #line:ch10_bark_owa_001 #long
<<else>>
    Owa as "The eldest" [neutral]: At dusk we go to the shore. Stand at the back. Do not sing. You do not know the song. #line:ch10_bark_owa_002
<<endif>>
===
